@startmindmap 12-ui-information-architecture
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title PortCloak — UI Information Architecture (no sign-in)
* PortCloak
** Capture
*** Pick environment -> probe
*** Select realms\n(one snapshot each)
*** Options (users mode,\nverification, encryption)
*** Pick storage
*** Run + live progress
** Snapshots
*** Library across all storage\n(Tier 0 — no key needed)
*** <b>Inspect</b> (details, users,\nclients, keys, federations)
*** Verify integrity
*** Delete
** Restore
*** Pick snapshot + environment
*** Confirm preconditions\n(themes / provider JARs)
*** Strategy (overwrite/skip/merge)
*** Dry-run diff
*** Apply + post-check
** Activity / Audit
*** Live jobs + clone lifecycle
*** Interrupted -> Resume
*** History + redacted logs
** Configuration
*** <b>Environments</b>\n(where Keycloak runs)
**** Local — server folder
**** SSH — host + server folder
**** Docker — service / container
**** K8s / OC — namespace + workload
*** <b>Storage</b>\n(where snapshots live)
**** Disk — folder
**** SSH — remote folder
**** S3 — bucket + prefix
**** Azure / Azurite — container + prefix
*** Preferences
*** ~/.portcloak/config.yaml\n(secrets in OS keychain)
@endmindmap
